  * VeloxQuant-MLX v0.65.0                     (MIT License)
    Copyright (c) 2025-2026 Rajveer Rathod (https://github.com/rajveer43)
    Source: https://github.com/rajveer43/VeloxQuant-MLX at commit
    54989ee223611627592f7f9bd925e924658f1f22 (annotated tag v0.65.0).

    `src/primitives/kv_candidates/` (SC-20677) reimplements, in Rust and new
    MSL, the TurboQuant RVQ quantizer (randomized-Hadamard rotation, Lloyd-Max
    Gaussian stage-1 and Laplacian stage-2 codebooks, LSB-first packed index
    words), the RaBitQ sign-bit key encoding and XOR+popcount score model, the
    nibble-packed value layout, and the online-softmax fused decode-attention
    structure from that release. No upstream Python or Metal source file is
    copied verbatim.

